# File encoding (critical)

On this Windows machine, Cursor agent file writes can occasionally corrupt to UTF-16 (even on local SSDs).

- All `.ts`, `.tsx`, `.js`, `.json` files MUST be UTF-8 without BOM
- Prefer `StrReplace` over full `Write` when possible
- After bulk edits, run `npm run fix-encoding`
- esbuild/Vite fail on UTF-16 with `Expected ";" but found "\x00"`